            <td><img src="https://www.ameda.com/cdn/shop/files/collection-cup.jpg?v=1743459704&width=250" style="margin-left: 0; aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;" alt="Ameda GLO Integrated Cups"><p>Integrated Wearable Cups</p></td>
